OL,3,GNEWSA1960s 'police box' in city centre
OL,4,Aopens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "There's quite a
OL,7,Flot of interest to finally see it - and
OL,8,Fit is exactly what it would have been
OL,9,Flike inside."
